      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yakhuluma loMose enkangala yaseSinayi, ngenyanga yokuqala yomnyaka wesibili emva kokuphuma kwabo eGibithe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 12:1–13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yathi: Abantu bakoIsrayeli kabagcine iPhasika ngesikhathi salo esimisiweyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngosuku lwetshumi lane lwenyanga le, kusihlwa, lizakuligcina, ngoba kuyisikhathi salo esimisiweyo; uligcine ngokwezimiso zalo langokwemithetho yalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke uMose watshela abantu bakoIsrayeli ukuthi kumele ukuba bagcine iPhasika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagcina iPhasika enkangala yaseSinayi, ngenyanga yokuqala, ngosuku lwetshumi lane lwenyanga, kusihlwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakukhona amadoda athile ayengahlambulukanga ngoba ayethinte isidumbu, ayengelakugcina iPhasika ngalolosuku. Eza phambi kukaMose loAroni ngalolosuku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "athi kubo: Thina kasihlambulukanga ngoba sithinte isidumbu; sivinjelelwani ukunikela umnikelo weNkosi ngesikhathi sawo esimisiweyo phakathi kwabakoIsrayeli na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wathi kuwo: Manini, ukuze ngizwe ukuthi iNkosi izakuthini ngani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kuMose: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshono ebantwini bakoIsrayeli uthi: Uba kukhona phakathi kwenu umuntu loba owenzalo yenu ongcoliswe yikuthinta isidumbu, loba osekuhambeni, kumele ukuba agcine iPhasika leNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanjalo bazakuligcina ngenyanga yesibili, ngosuku lwetshumi lane, kusihlwa; bazakulidla lesinkwa esingelamvubelo lemibhida ebabayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabayikutshiya lutho kuze kube sekuseni, bangephuli thambo lalo; bazakuligcina ngokwezimiso zonke zePhasika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 12:46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.19.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joha 19:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa lowo ohlambulukileyo, ongekho ekuhambeni owala ukugcina iPhasika, uzakukhutshwa ebantwini bakibo, ngoba kanikelanga umnikelo weNkosi ngesikhathi sawo esimisiweyo; lowo uzakuthwala isono sakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba kuhlala phakathi kwenu owemzini othanda ukugcina iPhasika leNkosi ngokwesimiso sePhasika langokomthetho walo, kenze njalo. Lizakuba lesimiso sibe sinye kowemzini lakowokuzalwa elizweni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngosuku ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " elamiswa ngalo, iyezi lasibekela iTabernakeli, ithente lobufakazi; kusukela kusihlwa kwaze kwaba sekuseni laliphezu kweTabernakeli likhanya njengomlilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho iyezi lalisibekela ithente sonke isikhathi, libonakale linjengomlilo ebusuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakuthi lapho iyezi lisuka phezu kwethente labantu bakoIsrayeli basuke; lasendaweni lapho iyezi lima khona, labo bamise khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bakoIsrayeli bahamba, njalo bamisa, njengokulaya kweNkosi. Bahlala ezihonqweni ngesikhathi sonke iyezi elalihlala ngaso phezu kweTabernakeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lalapho iyezi lihlala phezu kweTabernakeli insuku ezinengi, abakoIsrayeli bayilalela iNkosi, kabahambanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakunjalo lalapho iyezi laliphezu kweTabernakeli insuku ezilutshwana nje; njengokulaya kweNkosi bahlala ezihonqweni; futhi bahamba njengokulaya kwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngesinye isikhathi iyezi lahlala kusukela kusihlwa kwaze kwaba sekuseni kuphela; lapho iyezi lisuka ekuseni, babehamba. Futhi uba iyezi lalihlala emini lebusuku, ekusukeni kwalo babehamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba iyezi lalihlala phezu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " insuku ezimbili, loba inyanga, loba umnyaka, abakoIsrayeli bahlala ezihonqweni, kabahambanga. Kodwa lapho lisuka, babehamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokulaya kweNkosi bamisa, langokulaya kwayo bahamba; balalela ilizwi leNkosi eyabalaya lona ngoMose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
